    },
    "decision": "is-tall is a separate component, not a variant. It swaps the heading class (heading-style-h4 to heading-style-h3), the caption class (text-style-caps-caption-16 to text-style-eyebrow-caps) and gives each item its own size and offset modifiers (xlarge inset, xlarge end, alternating). A variant only restyles an element's first class, and all four items share timeline-scatter-images_item, so per-item differences cannot be expressed.",
    "tallClasses": "Duplicated from timeline-scatter-images, then set_style (scope_component_id) on 16 elements to match the reference section: section, header, heading, list and captions carry is-tall; items are is-xlarge plus is-inset or is-end; wraps are is-xlarge. Read back equal to the reference section element for element. Prop ids are kept from the source; defaults set to the neighborhood/07 copy (beyond downtown san diego, Coronado Beach, oceanside, Coronado Beach, oceanside)."
  }
